[[2047,127,0,"<aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before\nremoving and refitting the pretensioner wiring harness the following\npreliminary operations must be carried out:Place\nthe ignition key in the OFF position and extract it;Disconnect the battery leads and insulate.Wait for 10 minutes before continuing.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/768.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000166.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>FOLLOW ALL THE RECOMMENDED SAFETY\nRULES (\n                                                         <a href=\"#/3238969\">7065A</a>\n                                                          - PRECAUTIONS).</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside>"],[594,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3237544\">1056B82</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238790\">7040A14</a></p><p>Remove the control unit bracket.</p>"],[598,127,0,"<p><strong>- 7040L44 rear compartment scuff strip - r r</strong>\n                                           (right and\nleft)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238841\">7040H36</a>\n                                           (right\nand left).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238853\">7040L40</a>\n                                           (right and\nleft).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238857\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (right\nand left).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238915\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (right\nand left).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238343\">5040D22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238802\">7040A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238117\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238851\">7040L28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238251\">5010B46</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238261\">5010C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238848\">7040L10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect pretensioner electrical connections (1a, 1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Driver&#x27;s seat belt pre-tensioner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237335\">Q20</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Front passenger seat belt pre-tensioner</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3237339\">Q21</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Disconnect air bag wiring electrical connections (2a (2b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2a</p></td><td><p>Pretensioner connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235822\">D61A</a></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2b</p></td><td><p>Pretensioner connection</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3235825\">D61B</a></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Disconnect the wiring harness retaining collars.</p><p>4. Remove the wiring harness.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019507.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the wiring is undamaged\nand that the individual conductors are firmly attached to the connections.</p><p>Check that the connections are fitted with\nanti-slip devices (secondary lock).</p><p>If necessary, check the continuity.</p><p>Fit the wiring harness, secure using retaining\ncollars and connect the electrical connections.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238848\">7040L10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238261\">5010C44</a>\n                                           (right\nand left).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238251\">5010B46</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238849\">7040L20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238851\">7040L28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238117\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238802\">7040A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238343\">5040D22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (right\nand left).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238915\">7050A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238857\">7045A10</a>\n                                           (right\nand left).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238853\">7040L40</a>\n                                           (right and\nleft).</p><p><a href=\"#/3238841\">7040H36</a>\n                                           (right\nand left).</p><p><strong>- 7040L44 rear compartment scuff strip - r r</strong>\n                                           (right and\nleft).</p>"],[594,127,0,"<p>Refit the bracket and secure using a threaded\nplug and nut.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238790\">7040A14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238795\">7040A31</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238829\">7040G20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238830\">7040G24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237544\">1056B82</a></p>"],[598,127,0,"<p>Check component operation after refitting.</p><p>Check the operation of the system using\nthe Examiner or another tester.</p>"]]